    "en": "I'm Benison, a full-stack developer and designer based in Douala, Cameroon, with over 5 years of experience building products end to end.\n\n## What I do\n\nI work across the whole stack, backend architecture, APIs, and databases on one side, interfaces and visual systems on the other. I like moving fluidly between the two: understanding how a technical decision shapes what a user actually feels, and letting a design ambition push me to find a better way to build it.\n\n## How I think about the work\n\nI care about the details most people never consciously notice, consistent spacing, a state that never leaves someone guessing, an API that fails predictably. Craft, to me, is less about chasing perfection and more about attention that compounds over time.\n\n## Outside of work\n\nWhen I'm not building, you'll usually find me deep in a video game, making or listening to music, dancing, behind a camera, on the court, or with a book in hand. That variety keeps the creative side of my brain fed, and it shows up in the work.",
